<main id="main" class="pg"><section class="pg-h"><svg class="lat" aria-hidden="true"><defs><pattern id="fh" width="90" height="78" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M45 6l30 17v32L45 72 15 55V23z"/></pattern></defs><rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#fh)"/></svg><div class="in"><div class="pg-eb">Questions</div><h1>Frequently asked <em>questions.</em></h1><p>Quick answers about Kultra, subscriptions, delivery and offers.</p></div></section><section class="fq"><div class="fq-in"><div class="fqs"><label class="vh" for="fq-s">Search questions</label><input id="fq-s" type="search" placeholder="Search questions" autocomplete="off"></div><div class="fqc" role="group" aria-label="Topics"><button type="button" data-g="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button><button type="button" data-g="p" aria-pressed="false">The product</button><button type="button" data-g="s" aria-pressed="false">Subscriptions</button><button type="button" data-g="d" aria-pressed="false">Delivery and returns</button><button type="button" data-g="o" aria-pressed="false">Samples and offers</button></div><div class="fqg" data-g="p"><h2>The product</h2><details><summary>How many servings are in a pouch?</summary><div class="ab">Each pouch holds about 30 servings. One serving is a 33g scoop.</div></details><details><summary>What is in Kultra Goat Whey?</summary><div class="ab">Three ingredients: goat whey concentrate, natural vanilla and stevia leaf. No gums, no fillers and no artificial sweeteners.</div></details><details><summary>How much protein is in a serving?</summary><div class="ab">Each 33g scoop has 26g of protein. The full nutrition panel and amino acid profile are on the <a href="/products/goat-whey-protein">product page</a>.</div></details><details><summary>Which flavours are available?</summary><div class="ab">Vanilla is available now. Dutch Chocolate and Unflavoured are coming soon.</div></details><details><summary>How do I use it?</summary><div class="ab">Mix one 33g scoop with water or milk, or blend it into a smoothie, stir it into porridge or use it in desserts.</div></details><details><summary>Is every batch tested?</summary><div class="ab">Yes. Every batch is tested, and Kultra is NSF GMP registered.</div></details><details><summary>Is Kultra a medicine?</summary><div class="ab">No. Kultra is a food supplement, not a medicine.</div></details></div><div class="fqg" data-g="s"><h2>Subscriptions</h2><details><summary>How does subscribing work?</summary><div class="ab">Subscribe and save 15% on every delivery for as long as you subscribe. Choose a delivery every 2, 4 or 6 weeks. Each bag holds about 30 servings, so pick the schedule that matches how often you have Kultra.</div></details><details><summary>Is there a minimum?</summary><div class="ab">There is a minimum of two orders after your first.</div></details><details><summary>How do I change or cancel?</summary><div class="ab">Our <a href="/policies/subscription-policy">cancellation policy</a> explains how to manage or cancel a subscription.</div></details></div><div class="fqg" data-g="d"><h2>Delivery and returns</h2><details><summary>How long does delivery take?</summary><div class="ab">Free UK delivery on every order, in 2 to 4 working days.</div></details><details><summary>Can I return a pouch?</summary><div class="ab">We offer easy returns on unopened pouches. Our <a href="/policies/refund-policy">refund policy</a> has the details.</div></details><details><summary>Do you deliver outside the UK?</summary><div class="ab">You can choose Canada, Ireland, the United Kingdom or the United States from the country selector at the bottom of any page. Our <a href="/policies/shipping-policy">shipping policy</a> covers delivery for each country.</div></details></div><div class="fqg" data-g="o"><h2>Samples and offers</h2><details><summary>How does the £10 sample work?</summary><div class="ab">Buy the £10 sample and £10 comes back as store credit for your next order. One £10 credit per customer, on your first sample order. Credit is applied at checkout on one-off orders and lasts 90 days. Subscription orders earn 15% off instead of store credit, and credit cannot be used to pay subscription renewals.</div></details><details><summary>Is there a discount for two bags?</summary><div class="ab">Buy one, get one 25% off: add two bags and the second is 25% off, applied automatically in your cart.</div></details><details><summary>How do I get £5 off?</summary><div class="ab">Answer four quick questions in our <a href="/pages/find-your-protein">protein quiz</a> and get £5 to spend. New customers only.</div></details></div><p class="fq-no" id="fq-no" hidden>No questions match that search. Try another word or <a href="/pages/contact">get in touch</a>.</p><div class="fq-cta"><h2>Still have a question?</h2><p>Send us a note and we’ll get back to you.</p><a class="pg-btn" href="/pages/contact">Contact us</a></div></div></section></main><script>{% raw %}(function(){var q=document.getElementById('fq-s'),bs=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.fqc button')),gs=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.fqg')),no=document.getElementById('fq-no'),g='all';
function run(){var t=q.value.trim().toLowerCase(),any=false;gs.forEach(function(gr){var vis=0;[].forEach.call(gr.querySelectorAll('details'),function(d){var ok=(g==='all'||gr.dataset.g===g)&&(!t||d.textContent.toLowerCase().indexOf(t)>-1);d.hidden=!ok;if(ok)vis++});gr.hidden=!vis;if(vis)any=true});no.hidden=any}
q.addEventListener('input',run);bs.forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){g=b.dataset.g;bs.forEach(function(x){x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',x===b)});run()})});})();{% endraw %}</script><script src="{{ 'kultra-nav.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>